{"id": "Dc1Sry9P8jk", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"WEBSITE\" to get this Free AI Website cloneer.\n\nThis free AI tool lets you clone any website with just one single screenshot.\n\nIt's called Screenshot to Code.\n\nIt's a fully open source project with over 72,000 stars on GitHub.\n\nYou just drop in a screenshot.\n\nIt reads the layout, the spacing, the fonts, and the colors.\n\nThen it builds the entire website for you.\n\nAnd it works on more than just screenshots.\n\nYou can give it a Figma design, reference images, or even a screen recording of a website.\n\nIt turns that into a fully working prototype in minutes.\n\nPlus you also get a live canvas.\n\nYou can tweak anything however you want directly inside it.\n\nNo more starting from a blank file every time you find a design you like.\n\nYou just capture it, feed it in, and let the tool rebuild it for you.\n\n#githubrepo #aiwebsites #aidesigning #websitecloner #screenshottocode", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788454673, "like_count": 2106, "comment_count": 2708, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1795693048286027a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.521, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM4vy3rlFl3eMD7qYN9m5PPcIGsnwiKVL9cJcCJ1PqvxQ-skDrbvBCUqsPCpUMHfmOBX9JB2cT3SeBd7ryLX4jMxcbID61LUu-_61s.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Ado1aOpBdZM-UpFS7dfA2RCdaAFzOm6-6kqEMFaA_euWNBrYdRpAnk1UBRuCFfbda20&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=HQOgW_rNbcUQ7kNvwHSGp6G&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Ch7r4mzQIFRy1H4m9QpThQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRl_9F15hhJ64htkscKGHYL_LGwJnUOSETWaW9edL-wVQ&oe=6AE6189D", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "n